Distillation targets: FID C=k_f·(I−I0)/Q_h2 reconstruction head plus carbon-mass identity; conjunctive THC-slip floor vs continue-venting vs flare ESD; FID-infra collusion; Rogowski I=k_r·V/f head plus I·f identity; isolate-floor bus vs keep-arcing vs shop-trip; exoneration against last-to-badge social pressure; BAM C=k_b·(I0−I)/Q and mass identities; bounded ACCEPT with compartment-out-of-scope; skip-isolate refusal under survey takt. Agentic value concentrates in three patterns: reconstruction-as-SoT on a physical THC/current/PM load the raw corridor cannot see, earned ACCEPT with an explicit physical out-of-scope object (C-1..C-5), and stop-then-hold so a REJECT does not become a flare/shop/stack kill.